{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然才第一天，但至少今天的考试结束了。", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "同学们的表情都显得轻松了一些。", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们也是一样。", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“樱乃考得怎么样？”", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 224, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“还可以，应该没问题。”", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 227, "voice": "sk3431", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不愧是你。”", "text_idx": 178, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 224, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“也没有喔，其实在边缘徘徊。”", "text_idx": 181, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 227, "voice": "sk3432", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……所以实际上是？”", "text_idx": 175, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 224, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“应该不会被爱理骂。”", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 227, "voice": "sk3433", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“听到这个我就安心了。”", "text_idx": 184, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 224, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“葛格呢？”", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 227, "voice": "sk3434", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“跟樱乃一样吧。”", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 224, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊唔唔～好羡慕你们两位～”", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 216, "voice": "ag3592", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁你……从这个表情来看，好像不用问了。”", "text_idx": 192, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 224, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“神明一定是讨厌女仆呢！”", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 216, "voice": "ag3593", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“所以没有对安洁微笑。”", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 216, "voice": "ag3594", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为你没有尽人事吧。”", "text_idx": 189, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 230, "voice": "sn2194", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“尽力了喔，几乎燃烧殆尽了。”", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 216, "voice": "ag3595", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“上次不是勉强及格了吗？”", "text_idx": 177, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "ht1146", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是的。这次真的是相当极限，在结果出来之前一秒都不能放松的感觉！”", "text_idx": 199, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 216, "voice": "ag3596", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天的结果应该在停笔那一刻就决定了吧……", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“还是转换一下心情，准备明天的考试比较好。”", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 224, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，心情是很重要的。”", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 230, "voice": "sn2195", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“光是想像瓜生趴在地上输给我的模样，就能提振精神用功。”", "text_idx": 183, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 230, "voice": "sn2196", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你是想着那种事念书的啊……”", "text_idx": 182, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 224, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“葛格也练习一下趴地吧？”", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 227, "voice": "sk3435", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“为了不要那样，明天也会加油的。”", "text_idx": 180, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 224, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁、安洁已经……想出发到远方旅行了！”", "text_idx": 191, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 216, "voice": "ag3597", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那样的话，回来还要补考。”", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 227, "voice": "sk3436", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“囧！说的也是。安洁，果然还是现在开始努力！”", "text_idx": 190, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 216, "voice": "ag3598", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“对啊，明天也……”", "text_idx": 193, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 224, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "突然感觉到被注视。", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 173, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 224, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我若无其事地往那个方向看去，有好几个女孩子正看着我们这边。", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……是不认识的人。", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "怎么回事？", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "好奇……虽然有这种感觉，不过好像有点奇怪。", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且她们是看着我……跟樱乃？", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“樱乃，你认识那些女孩子吗？”", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 224, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不，不认识。”", "text_idx": 179, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 227, "voice": "sk3437", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一发现我们注意到，女孩们就慌张地跑掉了。", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“怎么了？”", "text_idx": 196, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "ht1147", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……没什么。”", "text_idx": 176, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 224, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我轻轻摇头。", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那些女孩们离去前的表情，感觉笑得有点阴狠……", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "是我想太多了吧。", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哥哥，在担心考试？”", "text_idx": 185, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 227, "voice": "sk3438", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，因为才刚开始。”", "text_idx": 187, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 224, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我摸摸她的头。", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……嗯，但是一定没问题。”", "text_idx": 174, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 227, "voice": "sk3439", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是啊。”", "text_idx": 198, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 224, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我点点头，但还是有点在意。", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "为什么呢？", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然跟合并试办刚开始时不太一样──", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我觉得学校的空气又变得混浊。", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
